{"strongs": "H3383", "word": "יַרְדֵּן", "translit": "yar.den", "root": "ירדן", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a river", "gloss": "Jordan", "definition": "יַרְדֵּן 182 proper name, of a river Jordan (according to Rel Ol § 215 c , from ירד with ןֵ֯ for original ןַ֯ , compare ᵐ5 ὁ Ιορδανης ; = river as flowing downward, descending , then of particular stream as river Κατ’ ἐξοχήν . See also Sta § 294 e ( ןֵ֯ for ןֶ֯ , but name according to Sta non-Hebrew)) — absolute always ׳ הַיַּר in prose Gen 13:10 + 162 t.; with ה locative הַיַּרְדֵּ֫נָה Judg 8:4 + 3 t.; יַרְדֵּן only Ps 42:7 ; Job 40:23 construct יַרְדֵּן Num 26:3 + 11 t. Numbers Josh + 1Chr 6:63 — the river of Palestine: in all periods, chiefly Hexateuch (122 t.: Gen 5 t. J ; Num 20 t. P , 1 t. J E ; Deut 26 t.; Josh 34 t. J E , 20 t. D , 16 t. P ), Judges (12 t.), and Samuel (18 t.); in Kings 13 t.; Chronicles 7 t.; elsewhere 10 t.; — הַיַּרְדֵּן הַזֶּה Gen 32:11 ( J ), Deut 3:27 ; Deut 31:2 ; Josh 1:2 ; Josh 1:11 ; Josh 4:22 (all D ); בְּעֵבֶר הַיַּרְדֵּן Gen 50:10 ; Gen 50:11 ( J ), Josh 7:7 ; Josh 24:8 (both J E ), + 20 t. D + Judg 5:17 ; Judg 10:8 ; 1Sam 31:7 P has also מֵעֵבֶר הַיַּרְדֵּן Num 32:19 , and לַיַּרְדֵּן ׳ מֵע v Num 32:19 v Num 32:32 ; Num 35:14 ; Josh 14:3 , also Josh 17:5 ( J E ), Josh 18:7 ( D ), Judg 7:25 ; 1Chr 12:37 ; 1Chr 26:30 in P peculiarly יַרְדֵּן יְרֵחוֺ the Jordan of (at) Jericho , with עַל Num 26:3 ; Num 26:63 ; Num 31:12 ; Num 33:48 ; Num 33:50 ; Num 35:1 ; Num 36:13 , with מֵעֵבֶר לְ Num 22:1 ; Num 34:15 ; Josh 13:32 ; Josh 20:8 (= 1Chr 6:63 ), with מִן Josh 16:1 (E?); עֵבֶר הַיַּרְדֵּן Isa 8:23 ; Deut 4:49 ; Josh 13:27 ( P ); see below עבר ; מֵי הַיַּרְדֵּן Josh 3:13 (twice in verse); Josh 4:18 ; Josh 4:23 (all J E ), Josh 3:8 ; Josh 5:1 (both D ); מֵימֵי הַיַּרְדֵּן Josh 4:7 ( J E ); ׳ גְּאוֺן הַיַּר Jer 12:5 ; Jer 49:19 ; Jer 50:44 ; Zech 11:3 (see גאון a, above); שְׂפַת ׳ הַיּר 2Kgs 2:13 יוֺשֵׁב עַלהַֿיָּם וְעַל יַד הַיַּרְדֵּן Num 13:29 ( J E ; elsewhere in Numbers, P ); כִּכַּר הַיַּרְדֵּן the circle of Jordan , i.e. the plain about Jericho Gen 13:10 ; Gen 13:11 ( J ), 1Kgs 7:46 ; 2Chr 4:17 ׳ מַעְבְּרוֺת הַיַּר Judg 3:28 ; Judg 12:5 ; Judg 12:6 fords of the Jordan ; אֶלגְּֿגְּלִילוֺת הַיַּרְדֵּן אֶלעֵֿבֶר בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל Josh 22:11 , compare v Josh 22:10 (both P ; see גלילות above); אֶרֶץ יַרְדֵּן Ps 42:7 (without article only here and in following); יָגִּיחַיַרְדֵּן אֶלפִּֿיהוּ Job 40:23 a Jordan bursteth forth into his mouth.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3720')\">BDB3720</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3383')\">H3383</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3719')\">BDB3719</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3721')\">BDB3721</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יַרְדֵּן</bdbheb><sub>182</sub> <b>proper name, of a river</b> <highlightword>Jordan</highlightword> (according to Rel <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol<sup>§ 215 c</sup></lookup>, from <bdbheb>ירד</bdbheb> with <bdbheb>ןֵ֯</bdbheb> for original <bdbheb>ןַ֯</bdbheb>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>ὁ Ιορδανης</grk>; = river as flowing <highlight>downward, descending</highlight>, then of particular stream as river <grk>Κατ’ ἐξοχήν</grk>. See also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>§ 294 e</sup></lookup> (<bdbheb>ןֵ֯</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>ןֶ֯</bdbheb>, but name according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta</lookup> non-Hebrew)) — absolute always <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַיַּר</bdbheb> in prose <ref ref=\"Gen 13:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,10)\">Gen 13:10</ref> + 162 t.; with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative <bdbheb>הַיַּרְדֵּ֫נָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 8:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,4)\">Judg 8:4</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>יַרְדֵּן</bdbheb> only <ref ref=\"Ps 42:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,42,7)\">Ps 42:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,23)\">Job 40:23</ref> construct <bdbheb>יַרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 26:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,3)\">Num 26:3</ref> + 11 t. Numbers Josh + <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:63\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"63\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"63\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,63)\">1Chr 6:63</ref> — the river of Palestine: in all periods, chiefly Hexateuch (122 t.: <ref ref=\"Gen 5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,1)\">Gen 5</ref> t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; <ref ref=\"Num 20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,1)\">Num 20</ref> t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, 1 t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; <ref ref=\"Deut 26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,1)\">Deut 26</ref> t.; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Josh 34\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(6,34,1)\">Josh 34</ref> t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>, 20 t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>, 16 t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), Judges (12 t.), and Samuel (18 t.); in Kings 13 t.; Chronicles 7 t.; elsewhere 10 t.; — <bdbheb>הַיַּרְדֵּן הַזֶּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,11)\">Gen 32:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 3:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,27)\">Deut 3:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,2)\">Deut 31:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 1:2\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(6,1,2)\">Josh 1:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 1:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,1,11)\">Josh 1:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 4:22\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,22)\">Josh 4:22</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>בְּעֵבֶר הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 50:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,10)\">Gen 50:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,11)\">Gen 50:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 7:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,7)\">Josh 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 24:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,8)\">Josh 24:8</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), + 20 t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup> + <ref ref=\"Judg 5:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,17)\">Judg 5:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 10:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,8)\">Judg 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 31:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,31,7)\">1Sam 31:7</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> has also <bdbheb>מֵעֵבֶר הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 32:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,19)\">Num 32:19</ref>, and <bdbheb>לַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֵע</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Num 32:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,19)\">Num 32:19</ref> v<ref ref=\"Num 32:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,32)\">Num 32:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 35:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,14)\">Num 35:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 14:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,14,3)\">Josh 14:3</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Josh 17:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,5)\">Josh 17:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 18:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,7)\">Josh 18:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 7:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,25)\">Judg 7:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:37\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,37)\">1Chr 12:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:30\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,30)\">1Chr 26:30</ref> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> peculiarly <bdbheb>יַרְדֵּן יְרֵחוֺ</bdbheb> <highlight>the Jordan of</highlight> (at) <highlight>Jericho</highlight>, with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 26:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,3)\">Num 26:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 26:63\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"63\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"63\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,63)\">Num 26:63</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,12)\">Num 31:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 33:48\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,48)\">Num 33:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 33:50\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,50)\">Num 33:50</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 35:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,1)\">Num 35:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 36:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,36,13)\">Num 36:13</ref>, with <bdbheb>מֵעֵבֶר לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 22:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,1)\">Num 22:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 34:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,15)\">Num 34:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:32\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,32)\">Josh 13:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 20:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,20,8)\">Josh 20:8</ref> (= <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:63\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"63\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"63\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,63)\">1Chr 6:63</ref>), with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 16:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,16,1)\">Josh 16:1</ref> (E?); <bdbheb>עֵבֶר הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,23)\">Isa 8:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:49\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,49)\">Deut 4:49</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,27)\">Josh 13:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); see below <bdbheb>עבר</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>מֵי הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 3:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,13)\">Josh 3:13</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Josh 4:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,18)\">Josh 4:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 4:23\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,23)\">Josh 4:23</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 3:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,8)\">Josh 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 5:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,5,1)\">Josh 5:1</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>מֵימֵי הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 4:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,7)\">Josh 4:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>גְּאוֺן הַיַּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 12:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,12,5)\">Jer 12:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,19)\">Jer 49:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:44\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,44)\">Jer 50:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 11:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,3)\">Zech 11:3</ref> (see <bdbheb>גאון</bdbheb> a, above); <bdbheb>שְׂפַת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַיּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,13)\">2Kgs 2:13</ref> <bdbheb>יוֺשֵׁב עַלהַֿיָּם וְעַל יַד הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 13:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,29)\">Num 13:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; elsewhere in Numbers, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>כִּכַּר הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <highlight>the circle of Jordan</highlight>, i.e. the plain about Jericho <ref ref=\"Gen 13:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,10)\">Gen 13:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 13:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,11)\">Gen 13:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,46)\">1Kgs 7:46</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,17)\">2Chr 4:17</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַעְבְּרוֺת הַיַּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 3:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,28)\">Judg 3:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 12:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,12,5)\">Judg 12:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 12:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,12,6)\">Judg 12:6</ref> <highlight>fords of the Jordan</highlight>; <bdbheb>אֶלגְּֿגְּלִילוֺת הַיַּרְדֵּן אֶלעֵֿבֶר בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 22:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,11)\">Josh 22:11</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Josh 22:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,10)\">Josh 22:10</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; see <bdbheb>גלילות</bdbheb> above); <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ יַרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 42:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,42,7)\">Ps 42:7</ref> (without article only here and in following); <bdbheb>יָגִּיחַיַרְדֵּן אֶלפִּֿיהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 40:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,23)\">Job 40:23</ref> <highlight>a Jordan bursteth forth into his mouth.</highlight> </p>